page("about","About Pivox Retail","Pivox Retail is operated by Pivox LLC, a Michigan online retailer of grocery and household goods.",f"""<section class="wrap doc"><h1>About Pivox Retail</h1><p class="lead">Pivox Retail is the online store of {NAME}, based in Okemos, Michigan.</p><p>We started Pivox Retail to make everyday purchases simple: the pantry staples, snacks and drinks people reorder again and again, from brands they already know, delivered in original packaging.</p><h2>How we operate</h2><ul><li><strong>Verified sourcing.</strong> We buy from authorized and verified suppliers and distributors.</li><li><strong>Nationwide warehousing.</strong> We keep inventory in several U.S. warehouses to shorten delivery times.</li><li><strong>Straightforward service.</strong> Clear pricing, tracked shipping and a 30-day return policy.</li></ul><h2>Company details</h2><p>{NAME}<br>{contact_lines}</p></section>""")
page("contact","Contact Us","Contact Pivox Retail, operated by Pivox LLC in Okemos, Michigan.",f"""<section class="wrap doc"><h1>Contact us</h1><p class="lead">Questions about an order, a return or our policies? Reach us using the details below.</p><h2>{NAME}</h2><p>{contact_lines}</p><h2>When you write to us</h2><p>Include your order number, the email used at checkout and a short description of the issue. We aim to reply within 2 business days (Monday to Friday, excluding U.S. holidays).</p></section>""")
doc("shipping","Shipping Policy","Pivox Retail shipping policy: handling time, delivery estimates, carriers and tracking.",f"""<h2>Where we ship</h2><p>We ship to addresses in the contiguous United States, including PO boxes where the carrier allows it. We do not currently ship to Alaska, Hawaii, U.S. territories, APO/FPO addresses or outside the U.S.</p><h2>Order handling</h2><p>Orders are processed within 1 to 2 business days. Orders placed after 2:00 PM Eastern Time, or on weekends and U.S. holidays, are processed the next business day.</p><h2>Delivery estimates</h2><p>Standard shipping typically arrives within 3 to 7 business days of dispatch. Items ship from the warehouse best placed to serve your address, so multi-item orders may arrive in separate packages.</p><h2>Carriers and tracking</h2><p>We use national carriers such as USPS, UPS and FedEx. A tracking number is sent once your order ships.</p><h2>Shelf-stable items only</h2><p>We ship shelf-stable products only. We do not ship items that need refrigeration or freezing.</p><h2>Shipping costs</h2><p>Shipping charges, if any, are shown before you complete an order.</p><h2>Delays, lost or damaged packages</h2><p>Weather, carrier issues and peak seasons can cause delays. If a package is lost or arrives damaged, contact us within 30 days of the delivery estimate and we will repair, replace or refund the order. See our <a href="/returns.html">Return Policy</a>.</p><h2>Address errors</h2><p>Please check your address before ordering. We cannot be responsible for orders delivered to an incorrect address supplied at checkout.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>{contact_lines}</p>""")
doc("returns","Return and Refund Policy","Pivox Retail return and refund policy: 30-day returns, damaged items and refund timing.",f"""<h2>30-day returns</h2><p>You may return most items within 30 days of delivery for a refund, if they are unopened, unused and in original packaging.</p><h2>Items we cannot accept back</h2><ul><li>Opened or used consumable goods, for food safety and hygiene reasons</li><li>Items with a missing or tampered seal</li><li>Items damaged after delivery through misuse</li></ul><h2>Damaged, defective or incorrect items</h2><p>If your order arrives damaged, defective, expired or is not what you ordered, contact us within 30 days of delivery with your order number and photos. We will send a replacement or issue a full refund, including original shipping, and you do not need to return the item.</p><h2>How to start a return</h2><ol><li>Contact us {reach}by mail at the address below with your order number.</li><li>We will confirm eligibility and send return instructions.</li><li>Pack the item securely and ship it using the method we provide.</li></ol><h2>Refunds</h2><p>Approved refunds go to the original payment method within 5 to 10 business days after we receive and inspect the return. Return shipping costs are the customer's responsibility unless the return is due to our error.</p><h2>Cancellations</h2><p>Orders can be cancelled before they ship. Contact us as soon as possible.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>{contact_lines}</p>""")
doc("privacy","Privacy Policy","How Pivox LLC collects, uses and protects personal information on pivoxretail.com.",f"""<p>{NAME} ("Pivox," "we," "us") operates {DOMAIN}. This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it and the choices you have.</p><h2>Information we collect</h2><ul><li><strong>Information you give us:</strong> name, shipping and billing address, email, phone number and the contents of messages you send.</li><li><strong>Order information:</strong> items purchased, order history and delivery details. Payments are handled by third-party payment processors; we do not store full card numbers.</li><li><strong>Automatic information:</strong> IP address, device and browser type, pages viewed and referring pages, collected through cookies and similar technologies.</li></ul><h2>How we use information</h2><p>To process and deliver orders, provide customer support, prevent fraud, improve our site, meet legal obligations and, where permitted, send service or marketing messages you can opt out of at any time.</p><h2>How we share information</h2><p>We share information with service providers that help us operate (payment processors, shipping carriers, warehouses, hosting and analytics) and when required by law. <strong>We do not sell your personal information.</strong></p><h2>Cookies</h2><p>We use cookies to keep the site working and understand usage. You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings, though some features may not work properly.</p><h2>Data retention and security</h2><p>We keep information only as long as needed for the purposes above or as required by law, and use reasonable administrative and technical safeguards. No system is completely secure.</p><h2>Your rights</h2><p>Depending on where you live (for example California and other U.S. states with privacy laws), you may have the right to know what personal information we hold, request access, correction or deletion, and opt out of sale or sharing. We do not discriminate against anyone for exercising these rights. To make a request, contact us {reach}by mail at the address below. We may need to verify your identity first.</p><h2>Children</h2><p>Our site is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their personal information.</p><h2>Changes</h2><p>We may update this policy and will post the new date at the top of this page.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>{NAME}<br>{contact_lines}</p>""")
doc("terms","Terms of Service","Terms of Service for using pivoxretail.com and purchasing from Pivox LLC.",f"""<p>These Terms govern your use of {DOMAIN} and purchases from {NAME}. By using the site you agree to them.</p><h2>Eligibility</h2><p>You must be at least 18 years old, or have a parent or guardian's permission, to place an order.</p><h2>Products and pricing</h2><p>We try to show accurate descriptions, images and prices, but errors can occur. We may correct errors, update listings and cancel orders affected by a pricing or availability error, with a full refund. Product images are for illustration, and packaging may vary.</p><h2>Orders and payment</h2><p>An order is an offer to buy. We accept it when we ship the item. We may refuse or cancel orders for suspected fraud, stock issues or other reasons. Taxes are added where required.</p><h2>Shipping and returns</h2><p>Our <a href="/shipping.html">Shipping Policy</a> and <a href="/returns.html">Return and Refund Policy</a> are part of these Terms.</p><h2>Acceptable use</h2><p>You agree not to misuse the site, attempt unauthorized access, interfere with its operation, scrape it without permission or use it for unlawful purposes.</p><h2>Intellectual property</h2><p>Site content, design and logos belong to {NAME} or its licensors. Third-party brand names and trademarks belong to their owners and appear only to identify genuine products; their use does not imply endorsement.</p><h2>Disclaimers</h2><p>The site and products are provided "as is" to the fullest extent permitted by law, without warranties of any kind beyond those required by law or provided by the manufacturer. Consult product labels for ingredients, allergens and safe use.</p><h2>Limitation of liability</h2><p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, {NAME} is not liable for indirect, incidental or consequential damages, and our total liability for any claim will not exceed the amount you paid for the product in question.</p><h2>Governing law</h2><p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Michigan, without regard to conflict-of-law rules. Disputes will be brought in the state or federal courts located in Michigan, unless applicable law says otherwise.</p><h2>Changes</h2><p>We may update these Terms by posting the new version here.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>{NAME}<br>{contact_lines}</p>""")
doc("accessibility","Accessibility Statement","Pivox Retail's commitment to an accessible website.",f"""<p>{NAME} wants everyone to be able to use {DOMAIN}. We aim to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 Level AA and test pages for keyboard navigation, readable contrast and screen reader support.</p><p>If you have trouble using any part of the site, or need information in another format, contact us {reach}by mail below and we will help you complete your request.</p><p>{contact_lines}</p>""")
